monster_panel

This repository combines a Marzban panel customization, deployment and migration
tools, node provisioning scripts, and synthetic tests. It does not contain
operator credentials, production deployment data, or user databases.

Marzban and Marzban-node are upstream projects maintained by Gozargah:
https://github.com/Gozargah/Marzban
https://github.com/Gozargah/Marzban-node

The panel and node installer retain their existing GNU Affero General Public
License in LICENSE. The node installer's commit history has been merged into
this repository. Upstream container images retain their own copyright and
license notices.
